OL,3,GNEWSAFears over plan for 'massive' data
OL,4,Acentre near village
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan for a "massive" data centre
OL,7,Fclose to a small village could claim a
OL,8,Flarge area of land on the edge of the
OL,9,FCheshire countryside.
OL,11,FThe scheme, which is earmarked for a
OL,12,Fspace close to Little Bollington near
OL,13,FLymm has been put forward by a company
OL,14,Fcalled Innova.
OL,16,FResidents have been receiving leaflets
OL,17,Fabout the bid in recent weeks, and some
OL,18,Fhave told the BBC they are "extremely
OL,19,Fworried" about the potential impact on
OL,20,Ftheir homes, businesses and wildlife.
